OL,5,G1520 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FMichael and his mum Lorna host at
OL,7,     FEdmund House in Deal, Kent. One
OL,8,     Fguest is less than thrilled by the
OL,9,     F'no-frills' experience, and others
OL,10,     Fdon't fancy the activity:
OL,11,     Fcompetitive dog grooming.
OL,12,G1550 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FEntrepreneur Mark hosts at the
OL,14,     FFive Bells Pub in Berkshire. But
OL,15,     Fhis guests don't all share his
OL,16,     Fpassion for beer - and is he too
OL,17,     Fhonest for his own good?
OL,18,G1620 Four in a Bed
OL,19,     FThe B&Bers meet for one last time
OL,20,     Fto discover how much they've been
OL,21,     Fpaid, settle some scores and find
OL,22,     Fout who's won.
