OL,5,G1850 The Dog House
OL,6,     FWill nervous young Labrador Loki
OL,7,     Ffind a new home with seasoned dog
OL,8,     Fowner Sharron? A small terrier
OL,9,     Fcalled Midnight seeks a potential
OL,10,     Fforever home with a young couple.
OL,11,G1955 The Dog House
OL,12,     FPoodle-cross Wally struggles to
OL,13,     Ffind a home due to his tricky
OL,14,     Fbehaviour. And will Janet, who's
OL,15,     Flooking for company after losing
OL,16,     Fher husband, bond with bichon
OL,17,     Ffrise Bruce?
